=11\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by harungurcan\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=otNV1MviJsA&amp;t=20s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=otNV1MviJsA&amp;t=20s</a>\n</p><p>~harungurcan\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28Solve_under_60_seconds.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(Solve_under_60_seconds!!!)\">Video Solution (Solve under 60 seconds!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (Solve under 60 seconds!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6O5UXi-Jwv4?si=KvvABit-3-ZtX7Qa&amp;t=681\">https://youtu.be/6O5UXi-Jwv4?si=KvvABit-3-ZtX7Qa&amp;t=681</a> \n</p><p>~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Dr. David\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ong72hi801E\">https://youtu.be/Ong72hi801E</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by WhyMath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free